  "excerpt": "BJ’s Restaurant Brewhouse Daily Specials, Deals, and Happy Hours: Complete Guide with Menu Prices If you’re searching for the best daily specials, deals, and happy hours at BJ’s Restaurant Brewhouse, you’re in the right place. Whether you’re craving pizza, ribs, a craft beer, or the famous Pizookie®, this guide covers everything — daily brewhouse specials, … Read more",
  "html": "<h1>BJ’s Restaurant Brewhouse Daily Specials, Deals, and Happy Hours: Complete Guide with Menu Prices</h1>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2379\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2379\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2379\" src=\"/img/wp/bcaa34ec51-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-16pm.webp\" alt=\"Friends toasting craft beers and enjoying deep dish pizza, ribs, and Pizookie at BJ&#039;s Restaurant Brewhouse during happy hour.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/bcaa34ec51-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-16pm.webp 1024w, /img/wp/fcfa2f5689-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-16pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/3826ffee01-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-16pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/fad53cd93f-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-16pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/e202eeefcd-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-16pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/e358dca049-generated-image-october-17-2025-2-16pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2379\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Discover the best daily specials, deals, and happy hour timings at BJ&#8217;s Restaurant Brewhouse for pizza, ribs, craft beer, and Pizookie®.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>If you’re searching for the best daily specials, deals, and happy hours at BJ’s Restaurant Brewhouse, you’re in the right place. Whether you’re craving pizza, ribs, a craft beer, or the famous Pizookie®, this guide covers everything — daily brewhouse specials, prices, happy hour timings, discounts, and exclusive menu promotions you don’t want to miss.</p><p>From Monday through Sunday, BJ’s makes dining out or ordering takeout delicious and affordable. Let’s break down all the daily deals, coupons, codes, happy hour specials, and menu items — so you can plan your next visit like a pro. If you’re interested in how American chain restaurants shape dining trends, check out <a href=\"https://www.restaurantbusinessonline.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">this informative article by Restaurant Business Online</a>.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>BJ’s Restaurant Brewhouse: A Favorite Dining Destination</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2381\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2381\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2381\" src=\"/img/wp/e74de15e50-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm.webp\" alt=\"Group of happy friends dining and toasting beers at a BJ&#039;s Restaurant Brewhouse, enjoying pizza, ribs, and Pizookie in a lively atmosphere.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/e74de15e50-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm.webp 1024w, /img/wp/637d141459-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/38777ba73e-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/53da1d9d22-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/8a82ac1856-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/d7e4569dbf-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2381\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Friends gather at BJ&#8217;s Restaurant Brewhouse, enjoying a vibrant dining experience with delicious food and signature craft beers.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>BJ’s Restaurant Brewhouse is more than just a restaurant — it’s an American casual dining chain known for its huge menu, craft beer selection, and iconic Pizookie® dessert. With over 200 locations, BJ’s attracts crowds looking for good food, craft cocktails, and daily brewhouse specials that offer amazing value.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re dining at the mall, grabbing takeout for home, or meeting friends for happy hours, BJ’s daily deals keep your wallet happy while you enjoy signature dishes, deep-dish pizza, ribs, and more.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Why People Love BJ’s Daily Brewhouse Specials</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2382\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2382\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2382\" src=\"/img/wp/27c80f64f1-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-1.webp\" alt=\"Friends toasting with craft beers over a spread of pizza, ribs, and Pizookie dessert at BJ&#039;s Brewhouse, highlighting the enjoyment of daily specials.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/27c80f64f1-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-1.webp 1024w, /img/wp/92166a0544-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-1.webp 300w, /img/wp/cccee503bf-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/a55f4b679c-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-1.webp 768w, /img/wp/6e5d6e204c-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-1.webp 500w, /img/wp/9d30c23300-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2382\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Guests celebrate the variety and value of BJ&#8217;s daily brewhouse specials, including half-off pizza, discounted prime rib, and the Pizookie Meal Deal.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>One thing that keeps guests coming back is the variety of specials every day — from half-off deep dish pizza to discounted prime rib, $15.99 deals, or the famous 13 Pizookie Meal Deal.</p>\n<p>Combine these daily brewhouse specials with BJ’s extensive craft beer, cocktail, and appetizer lineup, and you’ve got a restaurant that satisfies every craving without breaking the bank.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Complete Daily Specials Schedule: Deals for Every Day of the Week</h2>\n<p>BJ’s daily brewhouse specials make every day feel like a holiday. Below is the full breakdown of what you can expect day by day.</p>\n<hr />\n<h3>Monday Specials: Half Off Pizza and More</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2383\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2383\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2383\" src=\"/img/wp/3f88d8d531-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-2.webp\" alt=\"Hand slicing a large deep-dish pepperoni pizza with a &quot;Monday Special: Half-Off Pizza&quot; sign, and a couple toasting beers in the background at BJ&#039;s Brewhouse.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/3f88d8d531-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-2.webp 1024w, /img/wp/f3c98f13db-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-2.webp 300w, /img/wp/adb5d21e36-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-2.webp 150w, /img/wp/c2c6928c30-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-2.webp 768w, /img/wp/09e86b4b26-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-2.webp 500w, /img/wp/fede4303b2-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-2.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2383\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Enjoy BJ&#8217;s popular Monday special: half-off any large deep-dish pizza for dine-in guests at participating locations.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>BJ’s Monday special is one of the most popular — enjoy half-off deep-dish pizza when you dine in.</p>\n<p><strong>Monday Deal Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Deal:</strong> Half-off any large deep dish pizza</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Price Example:</strong> $15.99 pizzas drop to about $8</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Time:</strong> Dine-in, Monday only</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Where:</strong> Participating restaurants</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3>Tuesday</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2384\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2384\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2384\" src=\"/img/wp/98b8156025-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-3.webp\" alt=\"Sliced prime rib dinner with a baked potato and broccoli, accompanied by a &quot;Tuesday Special: $15.99 Prime Rib Night&quot; sign at BJ&#039;s Restaurant Brewhouse.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/98b8156025-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-3.webp 1024w, /img/wp/90512e54cc-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/51c85be2b8-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-3.webp 150w, /img/wp/346a995dd1-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-3.webp 768w, /img/wp/4155147c1b-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-3.webp 500w, /img/wp/0ea27c0261-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-3.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2384\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Indulge in BJ&#8217;s Tuesday special: a delicious prime rib dinner for just $15.99, served with two signature sides after 4 PM.</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>Specials: $15.99 Prime Rib Night</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Tuesdays are prime time for prime rib lovers. For j</p>\n<p>ust $15.99, get a delicious cut of prime rib that includes two signature sides.</p>\n<p><strong>Tuesday Deal Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> Prime Rib Dinner for $15.99</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Includes:</strong> Baby back ribs or bone-in pork option at select locations</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Sides:</strong> Soup or starter, salad, or signature sides</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>When:</strong> Tuesday after 4 PM</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Where:</strong> Dine-in at participating BJ’s Restaurant Brewhouse locations</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3>Wednesday Specials: 13 Pizookie Meal Deal</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2385\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2385\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2385\" src=\"/img/wp/b075a78d2f-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-4.webp\" alt=\"A &quot;Wednesday Special: 13 Pizookie Meal Deal&quot; sign next to a deep-dish pizza, side salad, and a Pizookie dessert, with a couple dining in the background at BJ&#039;s.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/b075a78d2f-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-4.webp 1024w, /img/wp/0dc4128b55-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-4.webp 300w, /img/wp/f455bd9338-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-4.webp 150w, /img/wp/85f45caae5-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-4.webp 768w, /img/wp/d3ce71db9b-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-4.webp 500w, /img/wp/b8fb69faa5-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-4.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2385\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Sweeten your midweek with BJ&#8217;s Wednesday special: the 13 Pizookie Meal Deal, offering a select entrée and a Pizookie® for only $13.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Midweek sweet tooth? Wednesdays are all about the legendary Pizookie®. The 13 Pizookie Meal Deal is a must.</p>\n<p><strong>Wednesday Deal Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> Get a select entrée and a Pizookie® dessert for only $13</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Popular Combo:</strong> Pizza with a house salad + Pizookie®</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Dine-in &amp; Takeout:</strong> Available both ways</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>When:</strong> Wednesdays, all day</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Price:</strong> $13 per person</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3>Thursday Specials: Baby Back Ribs</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2386\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2386\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2386\" src=\"/img/wp/3982a74ba3-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-5.webp\" alt=\"A rack of baby back ribs with a baked potato and broccoli, next to a &quot;Thursday Special: Baby Back Ribs&quot; sign at BJ&#039;s Restaurant Brewhouse.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/3982a74ba3-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-5.webp 1024w, /img/wp/5b75607263-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-5.webp 300w, /img/wp/0e70e669b3-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-5.webp 150w, /img/wp/93ba6dcfe0-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-5.webp 768w, /img/wp/0e35cff555-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/4ef51220f1-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-5.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2386\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Satisfy your BBQ cravings with BJ&#8217;s Thursday special on baby back ribs, including two signature sides, available for dine-in or takeout.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Thursdays bring out the BBQ fans. Get a half or full rack baby back ribs that includes two signature sides at a discounted price.</p>\n<p><strong>Thursday Deal Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> Rack baby back ribs with two signature sides</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Promotion:</strong> Make it a full rack for extra savings</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Price:</strong> Varies by location</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Time:</strong> Thursday only</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Where:</strong> Dine-in or takeout at participating restaurants</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3>Friday and Saturday Specials: Weekend Deals</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2387\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2387\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2387\" src=\"/img/wp/dc0f68d0ff-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-6.webp\" alt=\" A &quot;Weekend Specials&quot; sign highlighting extended happy hour, 10 menu items, and half-off Pizookie, with craft beers, pizza, fries, and Pizookie on the bar, and happy customers with a bartender in the background.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/dc0f68d0ff-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-6.webp 1024w, /img/wp/e2e491c6a0-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-6.webp 300w, /img/wp/fb032225cb-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-6.webp 150w, /img/wp/c28197e6b4-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-6.webp 768w, /img/wp/34049d8695-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-6.webp 500w, /img/wp/9794cab9ee-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-10pm-6.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2387\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Enjoy BJ&#8217;s weekend specials with extended happy hour, discounted menu items, and half-off select desserts like Pizookies® on Friday and Saturday evenings.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Weekends mean you can enjoy all the classics with family and friends. There are specials every day, but Fridays and Saturdays often highlight cocktails, craft beer promotions, and featured entrees.</p>\n<p><strong>Weekend Deal Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> Happy hour extended in the bar area</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Menu:</strong> 10 menu items at discounted prices</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Dessert:</strong> Half-off select desserts, including Pizookies®</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Time:</strong> Friday and Saturday evenings</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3>Sunday Specials: End the Week Right</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2388\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2388\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2388\" src=\"/img/wp/86df648da6-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm.webp\" alt=\"A &quot;Sunday Special: Rib Dinner &amp; Soup/Salad Combo&quot; sign next to a plate of prime rib and ribs, with soup and salad, and a couple toasting beers in the background at BJ&#039;s Restaurant Brewhouse.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/86df648da6-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm.webp 1024w, /img/wp/d1bb76dfb7-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/1a6bcf695a-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/5cd94b1d6d-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/365b056710-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/f497dd7f9e-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2388\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">End your week with BJ&#8217;s Sunday specials, featuring prime rib or baby back rib dinners, often with a soup and salad combo.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Sunday’s the perfect day for comfort food. BJ’s daily brewhouse specials on Sundays often include rib dinners and special dessert promos.</p>\n<p><strong>Sunday Deal Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> Prime rib or baby back ribs</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Includes:</strong> Soup and salad combo</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Price:</strong> Varies; check local offers</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Where:</strong> Dine-in or same-day takeout</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>BJ’s Happy Hours: Craft Beer, Cocktails &amp; Appetizers at a Discount</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2389\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2389\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2389\" src=\"/img/wp/7830a9891e-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm-1.webp\" alt=\"Group enjoying drinks and food at BJ’s Restaurant &amp; Brewhouse during happy hour, with beer, cocktail, fries, pizza, and a chalkboard sign listing weekday specials in a lively bar setting.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/7830a9891e-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm-1.webp 1024w, /img/wp/402f4dde54-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm-1.webp 300w, /img/wp/6ddada400f-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/818d027bd4-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm-1.webp 768w, /img/wp/219c41f043-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm-1.webp 500w, /img/wp/ecf1fd9363-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-12pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2389\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Cheers to happy hour at BJ’s Restaurant &amp; Brewhouse! Enjoy discounted craft cocktails, appetizers, and good company from 3–7pm and late night, Monday through Friday.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>BJ’s <strong>happy hours</strong> are the best time to pair a craft beer with a starter, salad, or pizza slice for less.</p>\n<p><strong>Happy Hour Specials:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Time:</strong> Monday through Friday, typically 3 PM – 7 PM</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Late Night:</strong> Some locations have late-night happy hours too</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Deals:</strong> Discounted craft beers, signature cocktails, appetizers</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Where:</strong> Bar area and dine-in only</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>Signature Dishes: From Deep Dish Pizza to Baby Back Ribs</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2390\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2390\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2390\" src=\"/img/wp/bfca504bd2-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm.webp\" alt=\"An overhead shot of a table laden with BJ&#039;s Restaurant Brewhouse signature dishes, including a deep-dish pizza, baby back ribs, steak, a Pizookie dessert, and a pint of craft beer.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/bfca504bd2-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm.webp 1024w, /img/wp/8d99ce2f85-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/0215cdcf82-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/8901e10d14-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/dbe4f9368c-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/a86db1c075-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2390\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Explore BJ&#8217;s most popular signature dishes, from deep dish pizza to baby back ribs, available with daily deals.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>What makes BJ’s Restaurant Brewhouse menu so tempting? Here’s a taste of their most popular signature dishes you can order during daily deals:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Deep Dish Pizza:</strong> Classic Chicago-style</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Baby Back Ribs:</strong> Full or half rack, includes two signature sides</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Prime Rib:</strong> Only $15.99 on Tuesdays</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Pizookie®:</strong> Iconic cookie dessert with ice cream</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Salads &amp; Soups:</strong> Chicken bacon ranch piadina, soup or starter combos</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Craft Beers:</strong> Pair any meal with house brews</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>Full BJ’s Menu Pricing Tables</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2391\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2391\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2391\" src=\"/img/wp/fa85164dfa-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-1.webp\" alt=\"A close-up of BJ&#039;s Restaurant &amp; Brewhouse menu on a wooden table, showing pricing tables for various dishes, with a deep-dish pizza and a glass of dark beer blurred in the background.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/fa85164dfa-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-1.webp 1024w, /img/wp/a21acad7fd-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-1.webp 300w, /img/wp/7cbf77da30-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/ca935d3bc5-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-1.webp 768w, /img/wp/334c78dbbd-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-1.webp 500w, /img/wp/7815d4b1d8-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2391\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Sample pricing tables for BJ&#8217;s menu items, including pizza, ribs, and desserts, to help plan your next visit.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Below are sample pricing tables so you can see how much you might spend on your next visit. Prices vary by location but are representative.</p>\n<h3>Pizza, Salad, and Appetizer Prices</h3>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th data-col-size=\"sm\">Menu Item</th>\n<th data-col-size=\"sm\">Price</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Deep Dish Pizza (Large)</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$15.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Pizza with House Salad</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$14.49</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Chicken Bacon Ranch Piadina</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$11.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Soup and Salad Combo</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$10.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Signature Starter</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$7.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Appetizer Sampler</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$13.99</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<h3>Rib and Prime Rib Pricing</h3>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th data-col-size=\"sm\">Menu Item</th>\n<th data-col-size=\"sm\">Price</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Half Rack Baby Back Ribs</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$17.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Rack Baby Back Ribs</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$24.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Prime Rib Dinner (Tuesday)</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$15.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Bone-In Pork Chop</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$18.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Rib Dinner (Sunday)</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$19.99</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<h3>Dessert Pricing</h3>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th data-col-size=\"sm\">Menu Item</th>\n<th data-col-size=\"sm\">Price</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Classic Pizookie®</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$6.95</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Mini Pizookie®</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$3.95</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">13 Pizookie Meal Deal</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$13.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Ice Cream Sundae</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$4.50</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<h2>Exclusive Pizookie® Deals and 13 Pizookie Meal Deal</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2392\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2392\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2392\" src=\"/img/wp/53f841258e-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-2.webp\" alt=\"A group of smiling friends sharing a large tray of individual Pizookie® desserts topped with ice cream and chocolate syrup, with a small sign indicating &quot;13 Pizookie Meal Deal\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/53f841258e-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-2.webp 1024w, /img/wp/3f16f194a2-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-2.webp 300w, /img/wp/3eac4ae00b-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-2.webp 150w, /img/wp/1463a15c51-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-2.webp 768w, /img/wp/22c8fe58fe-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-2.webp 500w, /img/wp/3032a61a79-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-23pm-2.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2392\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Discover exclusive Pizookie® deals, including the 13 Pizookie Meal Deal, perfect for sharing this iconic dessert.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>A visit to BJ’s isn’t complete without dessert. The Pizookie® is an iconic deep-dish cookie served warm with ice cream.</p>\n<p><strong>How to Save:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Order the 13 Pizookie Meal Deal every Wednesday</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Watch for promotions where you get a free Pizookie® with select entrees</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Mini Pizookies® are perfect for sharing</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>BJ’s Discounts, Coupons, Promo Codes, and Mall Promotions</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2393\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2393\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2393\" src=\"/img/wp/3b50566a81-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm.webp\" alt=\" A person&#039;s hands typing on a laptop with various BJ&#039;s Restaurant Brewhouse coupons, promo codes displayed on a smartphone, and a small BJ&#039;s gift bag on a wooden table, symbolizing savings and promotions.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/3b50566a81-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm.webp 1024w, /img/wp/92dc12c8d2-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/1732b8b7cd-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/c097b39453-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/885f1c732b-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/29985420fd-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2393\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Find out how to save with BJ&#8217;s discounts, coupons, promo codes, and special mall promotions throughout the year.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>BJ’s runs <strong>coupons</strong>, <strong>promo codes</strong>, and same-day discounts throughout the year. Here’s how to save more:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>BJ’s Promo Codes:</strong> Look online for promo codes for dine-in or takeout</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Mall Deals:</strong> Many mall locations have unique offers or gift card promotions</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Holiday Discounts:</strong> Special menus on holidays with included dessert</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Takeout Specials:</strong> Select menu items discounted for same-day online orders</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>BJ’s Coupon Tip:</strong> Sign up for emails to get exclusive coupon codes and daily deals</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>Takeout Specials &amp; Same-Day Deals</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2394\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2394\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2394\" src=\"/img/wp/f64e196b47-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-1.webp\" alt=\"A busy kitchen counter at BJ&#039;s Restaurant Brewhouse, with several takeout orders including pizzas, salads, and appetizers being prepared and packed into branded paper bags, alongside smartphones displaying online order discounts.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/f64e196b47-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-1.webp 1024w, /img/wp/296db7ce36-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-1.webp 300w, /img/wp/5442959d98-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/e0a884a69e-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-1.webp 768w, /img/wp/ca7ec25e51-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-1.webp 500w, /img/wp/b1fb302482-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2394\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Explore BJ&#8217;s convenient takeout specials and same-day deals, perfect for enjoying your favorite meals at home.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Can’t dine in? BJ’s offers plenty of <strong>takeout specials</strong> and same-day promos.</p>\n<p><strong>Popular Takeout Offers:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Deep dish pizza and salad combos</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Soup and salad packs</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Appetizer samplers</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Same-day online orders often include a discount code</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>BJ’s Brewhouse Bar Area Specials</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2395\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2395\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2395\" src=\"/img/wp/3004f041b5-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-2.webp\" alt=\"A lively bar scene at BJ&#039;s Restaurant Brewhouse, with customers enjoying craft beers, cocktails, pizza, and appetizers on the wooden bar top, while a bartender pours drinks in the background.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/3004f041b5-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-2.webp 1024w, /img/wp/a3795b98a6-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-2.webp 300w, /img/wp/e4a3f7431c-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-2.webp 150w, /img/wp/a041979563-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-2.webp 768w, /img/wp/0ab90fcb4f-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-2.webp 500w, /img/wp/a09b5b692b-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-2.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2395\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Unwind with BJ&#8217;s Brewhouse bar area specials, featuring discounted craft beers, cocktails, and appetizers during happy hour.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Want to unwind with craft beer? Head to the bar area for happy hour specials that include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Signature craft beers at discounted prices</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Craft cocktails for less</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Appetizers and pizza slices</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Perfect for after work or mall shopping trips</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For an overview of pairing craft beer with meals, read CraftBeer.com’s pairing guide.</p>\n<hr />\n<blockquote>\n<p>Craving wings and want the best bang for your buck? Check out the full breakdown of Buffalo Wild Wings’ deals here: <a href=\"/bw3-daily-specials-guide-best-buffalo-wild-wings-deals-bogo-wing-offers/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">BWW Daily Specials Guide – Best Buffalo Wild Wings Deals &amp; BOGO Wing Offers</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2396\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2396\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2396\" src=\"/img/wp/8a91b25af8-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-3.webp\" alt=\"A modern infographic titled &quot;Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)&quot; with distinct sections answering common questions about BJ&#039;s Restaurant Brewhouse, including details on the &quot;13 Pizookie Meal Deal,&quot; &quot;Takeout Specials,&quot; &quot;Using Coupons with Deals,&quot; and &quot;Best Day for Ribs.&quot; The design is clean and easy to read, set against a subtle, blurred restaurant background.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/8a91b25af8-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-3.webp 1024w, /img/wp/4a4979be2d-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/c4601bf1cb-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-3.webp 150w, /img/wp/5f34bfe69c-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-3.webp 768w, /img/wp/899b5bae22-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-3.webp 500w, /img/wp/1bbc4860af-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-3.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2396\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Find quick answers to frequently asked questions about BJ&#8217;s daily deals, Pizookie® costs, takeout availability, and coupon usage.</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>How much does the 13 Pizookie Meal Deal cost?</h3>\n<p>It’s $13 per person — includes an entrée and a Pizookie® dessert.</p>\n<h3>Are BJ’s daily brewhouse specials available for takeout?</h3>\n<p>Many are! Always check participating restaurants for dine-in vs. takeout availability.</p>\n<h3>Can I use a coupon with daily deals?</h3>\n<p>BJ’s accepts valid promo codes and offers but some discounts may not be combined.</p>\n<h3>What’s the best day to visit for ribs?</h3>\n<p>Thursdays and Sundays feature baby back rib specials, often with signature sides included.</p>\n<h3>Do all BJ’s locations have the same daily specials?</h3>\n<p>Most do, but check your local BJ’s — mall locations sometimes run unique promotions.</p>\n<hr />\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-8\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"6b45cb6e-04da-4169-83ed-9970f9297603\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<pre class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light\"><em>Discover our complete guide on <a href=\"/cracker-barrel-menu-with-prices-daily-specials-order-online-today/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">Cracker Barrel menu with prices daily specials order online today</a> to explore all Cracker Barrel daily specials, pricing details, and online ordering options.</em>\r\n</pre>\n<hr />\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<h2>Final Thoughts: Enjoy BJ’s Restaurant Brewhouse Deals Today</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2397\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2397\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2397\" src=\"/img/wp/74d8eda973-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-4.webp\" alt=\"Group of six people enjoying a meal at BJ’s Restaurant, raising glasses in celebration around a table filled with pizza, steak, dessert, and drinks, with a smartphone showing a 15% off online order promo.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/74d8eda973-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-4.webp 1024w, /img/wp/f0d90d0ad1-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-4.webp 300w, /img/wp/231f8a7f11-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-4.webp 150w, /img/wp/1ea2973fdc-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-4.webp 768w, /img/wp/0cff795d79-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-4.webp 500w, /img/wp/9762e1b5c4-generated-image-october-17-2025-4-24pm-4.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2397\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Celebrate good times at BJ’s Restaurant with friends, great food, and exclusive deals. Use the promo code for 15% off online orders while enjoying pizza, steak, and dessert in a lively setting.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>BJ’s Restaurant Brewhouse makes dining out fun, satisfying, and affordable with daily brewhouse specials, happy hours, and fan-favorite dishes like deep dish pizza and Pizookie® desserts. Whether you’re ordering a prime rib for $15.99 on Tuesday, enjoying happy hour beer and cocktails in the bar area, or picking up takeout for the family, BJ’s daily deals deliver delicious value every day of the week.</p>\n<p><strong>Don’t forget:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Visit your nearest BJ’s restaurant</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Check for the latest coupon or promo code</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Reserve your table or order online for same-day takeout</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Enjoy the best deals — and save room for a Pizookie®!</p>",
